  "description": "Project BMX Chrome Red: The Custom Electric BMX Bike by Evolve\n\nWe tracked down a small run of old-school red components and couldn’t resist. A Red Edition built for riders who want something loud, clean and full of character without losing that classic BMX feel.\n\nWheels: Old School Skyway 24\" Tuff Wheels in Red.\n\nHeritage hardware. Limited stock. A bike that brings proper old-school BMX energy with a modern electric punch.\n\nProject BMX is a visionary quest to seamlessly blend electric innovation with authentic BMX geometry, crafting an unparalleled ride experience tailored for cyclists who need a little more cool from their bike. The ethos was to make no sacrifices to the ride feeling or look of traditional BMX by using a nimble 24\" design for agility and fluidity. With stealthy integration of the technology to maintain traditional aesthetics, Project BMX does exactly that.\n\nRIDES LIKE A BIKE\n\nMany eBikes place their motors and batteries in positions that are easiest or cheapest, with little regard for the effect on the rider experience. Frame geometry and weight distribution are pivotal in electric bike design, optimising rider comfort and bike handling. The carefully calculated angles and weight placement on Project BMX lower the centre of gravity, enhancing stability and control, especially at higher speeds or during tight manoeuvres. When everything is dialled in like this, it is flat-out fun to ride.\n\nKEEPING IT REAL\n\neBikes can be big, bulky and a little bit ugly. We have painstakingly retained the iconic BMX spirit, seamlessly nestling the battery within the seat and embedding a potent mid-drive motor into the frame. The result is a sophisticated, perfectly balanced old-school BMX aesthetic that is guaranteed to draw attention.\n\nProject BMX is crafted with premium Chromoly frame and fork tubing courtesy of TANGE. It is a statement of quality built for people who take their fun seriously.",
